{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Intro_Panel.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Om's journey from being an amateur to an excellent sitarist as his travels bring him to a city that lives and breathes music. Explore its rich culture through food, art and stories that have been passed on for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Space_Rect.jpg.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Title_Panel.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Space_Rect.jpg.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/01.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play</strong> sitar,\u00a0<strong>compose</strong> your own music and<strong> customize</strong> your stage to bring more audience at your sitar shows during the weekly mela.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Gif-01.gif?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/02.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cook</strong> a variety of local dishes. Trade with the overseas' merchants for their recipes to serve in the Dhaba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/3d8947dc0eece8f944f4ed229e5c6971.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/3d8947dc0eece8f944f4ed229e5c6971.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/3d8947dc0eece8f944f4ed229e5c6971.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/03.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tune into the city's olden folklores through Kusum Dadi's stories every evening. <strong>Collect</strong>\u00a0and expand your collection of story cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/268aa34ffda118719f40da3081e489a7.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/268aa34ffda118719f40da3081e489a7.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/268aa34ffda118719f40da3081e489a7.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/04.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live carefree in a city filled with colorful graffiti, gorgeous temples and a vibrant culture.\u00a0Have fun in the weekly<strong>\u00a0mela</strong> (carnival), playing games and engaging with overseas' merchants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/44e1b34da7ed56c92c75fbdcae101e10.avif?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve a variety of creatively designed fun puzzles during your visit to the temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/52a404e27dd8785399f4c5958fa8e6dd.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/52a404e27dd8785399f4c5958fa8e6dd.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/52a404e27dd8785399f4c5958fa8e6dd.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/257aa5aa77f1eda15ca0b8caa01f7283.avif?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uplift your mood by playing little, relaxing games while laying on a bench, riding a boat or simply enjoy the still, cozy vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/f2b07758480a310215c58d41c475e9d8.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/f2b07758480a310215c58d41c475e9d8.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/f2b07758480a310215c58d41c475e9d8.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/05.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the history of the ruined Chet Fort. Team-up with Historian Mohan, collect clues from around the city and unmask the quiet mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/07.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek companionship with Siya, a fellow traveler and an artist. Go on dates, spend time together doing activities such as camel rides, exploring mela, decorating the city, or just a simple chai date along the riverbank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/d69fa0