class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/04.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live carefree in a city filled with colorful graffiti, gorgeous temples and a vibrant culture.\u00a0Have fun in the weekly<strong>\u00a0mela</strong> (carnival), playing games and engaging with overseas' merchants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/44e1b34da7ed56c92c75fbdcae101e10.avif?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve a variety of creatively designed fun puzzles during your visit to the temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/52a404e27dd8785399f4c5958fa8e6dd.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass