"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/07.png?t=1752496006\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek companionship with Siya, a fellow traveler and an artist. Go on dates, spend time together doing activities such as camel rides, exploring mela, decorating the city, or just a simple chai date along the riverbank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/d69fa0d5c9ebb8404328367f7fb5e45e.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/d69fa0d5c9ebb8404328367f7fb5e45e.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/d69fa0d5c9ebb8404328367f7fb5e45e.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Space_Rect.jpg.p